---
description: Recall Atmina shared memory before answering from training; capture durable decisions.
alwaysApply: true
---

Atmina is this team's shared memory. Capture decisions and findings into Atmina rather than leaving them only in chat. Link what you write to the pages you read, and cite your sources. Before answering from training about a team decision, procedure, or fact, search Atmina. To orient, search the Knowledge Base, read the best hit, and follow its links.
